  "provenance": "First-party synthetic transfer probes, fixed before the v2 prompt experiment. Authored with knowledge of baseline failures; not an independent holdout.",
  "label_policy": "Same four-field contract as classification-dev-v1. Includes paraphrases and negative contrasts. Known order retained absent explicit replacement; bare order routes to ORDER_STATUS.",
  "cases": [
